{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》今晚探討點心界的創新與傳統衝突！一間位於銅鑼灣的食店，大膽推出「黑金蝦餃」，以墨魚汁製成黑色外皮，雖然創意獲讚，但其顛覆傳統的賣相卻引發激烈爭議。「紅棉」行政總廚邵德龍更直言，此舉可能已犯下大忌，令蝦餃先天「輸蝕」！\n</p>\n<h2>鄭紫欣Jacques Kagi力撐中西合璧 堅持傳統13摺手藝</h2>\n<p>位於銅鑼灣的食店，在蝦餃製作上融合傳統與創新。師傅堅持以傳統「13 摺」手藝製作蝦餃，但在外皮和餡料上卻大膽革新，加入了墨魚汁和黑松露，製成獨特的「黑金蝦餃」。對於這個新派嘗試，「化學系靚廚」鄭紫欣表示欣賞：「咁創新嘅墨魚汁嘅皮做嘅黑松露蝦餃，我覺得 OK 嘅。」Jacques Kagi（祈積奇）亦大表認同，笑稱：「好似我咁中西合璧，好值得試。」</p>\n<h2>黃永幟嫌賣相唔吸引 邵德龍指非晶瑩剔透或成致命傷</h2>\n<p>儘管創意受到部分評審肯定，但蝦餃的黑色外觀卻觸動了傳統派的底線。名廚黃永幟坦言，黑色的蝦餃賣相不夠吸引。而「紅棉」行政總廚邵德龍更從市場角度分析，指出大眾對蝦餃普遍有著「晶瑩剔透」的既定印象，他語重心長地說：「當佢用咗墨魚汁可能就輸蝕咗。」這番言論點出了創新點心在挑戰食客傳統审美時所面臨的巨大風險。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議黑色蝦餃：究竟係創意定係黑暗料理</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，網民對於「黑色蝦餃」的接受程度意見不一，展開激烈討論。「黑色蝦餃真係接受唔到，蝦餃就應該係白雪雪、晶瑩剔透。」「我覺得好型喎！黑金色好高級，一定試！」「邵師傅講得啱，做生意要迎合大眾口味，太創新未必係好事。」「時代會變，點心都應該要變，支持廚師大膽嘗試！」「食落好食咪得囉，理得佢咩色！」<br/>\n龍點心（尖沙咀店）<br/>地址：九龍尖沙咀海防道38-40號中達大廈1樓全層<br/>\n龍點心（觀塘店）<br>地址：九龍觀塘觀塘道398-402號 Eastcore 1樓4號舖<br/>\n龍點心（銅鑼灣店）<br/>地址：香港島銅鑼灣波斯富街24-30號寶漢大廈2樓<br/>\n龍點心（灣仔店）<br/>地址：香港島灣仔軒尼詩道216-218號地下A&amp;B舖<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_11650365386af5421818327.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_11650365386af5421818327.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</br></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_20954645946af5422712b2e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_20954645946af5422712b2e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_3043670846af5422ad8ef9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_3043670846af5422ad8ef9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_1532591196af5422e7ad32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_1532591196af5422e7ad32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_19545737706af54232403c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_19545737706af54232403c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_18537130526af54235a59bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_18537130526af54235a59bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_11875854656af54238deab9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_11875854656af54238deab9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_891254496af5423c55e28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_891254496af5423c55e28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:04:23.245002+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1127,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:39:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:51.419764+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:57:51.419764+00:00","content_hash":"34d75413905bdb5be9f282798ce30d0ea8dd8b239cb453f7f4fd505fb67e8527","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}